te strange happenings across the city and uncover the secrets hidden behind its walls.\n\nCombat is turn-based, with a cast of unusual heroes who each bring their own skills, and some confrontations play out as card-based mind battles. The story is told with an anime-inspired style and plenty of noir atmosphere. It is a single-player game for fans of story-heavy Japanese-style RPGs."}}